::SQL Equi-and-Theta Join::
Which is a join condition that contains an equality operator
{
    ~Cartesian
    =Equi join
    ~Both Equi join and Cartesian
    ~None of the above
}

::SQL Equi-and-Theta Join::
What is a theta join in SQL?
{
    ~A join that uses a comparison operator to match rows from two tables based on a specified condition
    ~A join that uses the LIKE operator to match rows from two tables based on a specified condition
    ~A join that uses the BETWEEN operator to match rows from two tables based on a specified condition
    ~None of the above
}


